0007FAr 1               ; ---- present: FB to the screen ----------------------------------------------------
0007FAr 1               ; Each character (2 x 4 pixels, bit 2k = row k's left pixel, 2k+1 its right)
0007FAr 1               ; becomes 3 screen pixels across (left, left, right at an even column; left,
0007FAr 1               ; right, right at an odd one) by 8 lines (each pixel row twice).  Eight
0007FAr 1               ; characters are 24 pixels: three cells.  Only groups that changed are drawn.
0007FAr 1               present:
0007FAr 1  A9 00                lda     #0
