0009D6r 1               
0009D6r 1               ; the colours of pixel row cl_b of cell X: A for its first screen line,
0009D6r 1               ; cl_2 for its second.  A thing there: its colour on black (in a wall) or on
0009D6r 1               ; the ceiling / floor band; a wall: its colour on black; else the band.
0009D6r 1               strip_col:
