000C98r 1  A2 00                ldx     #0              ; the big letters, into FB (rows 4-7, columns
000C9Ar 1  A9 00                lda     #0              ; 26-53), then onto the screen
000C9Cr 1  9D 00 5E 9D  @fc:    .repeat 6, K
