00151Br 1               ; draw column col: ceiling (blank), wall (pat) from y0 to y1, floor below.
00151Br 1               ; Character rows r0 .. r1 hold the wall; the first and last may be partly
00151Br 1               ; wall and partly background: (pat & mask) | (floor & ~mask).
00151Br 1               ; The background goes in first (bg_chain), then the whole wall characters
00151Br 1               ; (a run of wall_chain, stopped by a temporary RTS), then the two ends.
